---
// The "race bib meets calendar" mark (option B on the logo canvas).
---
<span aria-hidden="true" style="position: relative; display: inline-block; width: 38px; height: 34px; flex: 0 0 auto">
  <span style="position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; height: 29px; border-radius: 5px; background: #EDEAE3; overflow: hidden; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center">
    <span style="position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; top: 0; height: 7px; background: #4AB8D4"></span>
    <span style="position: absolute; left: 4px; bottom: 4px; width: 3px; height: 3px; border-radius: 999px; background: #1C1C1E"></span>
    <span style="position: absolute; right: 4px; bottom: 4px; width: 3px; height: 3px; border-radius: 999px; background: #1C1C1E"></span>
    <span style="margin-top: 6px; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1; color: #1C1C1E">PT</span>
  </span>
  <span style="position: absolute; left: 9px; top: 0; width: 4px; height: 9px; border-radius: 2px; background: #EDEAE3"></span>
  <span style="position: absolute; right: 9px; top: 0; width: 4px; height: 9px; border-radius: 2px; background: #EDEAE3"></span>
</span>
